    <artifactId>ip-intelligence.cloud</artifactId>
    <name>51Degrees :: IP Intelligence :: Cloud</name>
    <description>IP Intelligence and IP geolocation for Java, using the 51Degrees cloud service. Finds an IP address's likely location (country, region, town, and coordinates), connection type, and network. Needs a Resource Key that says which properties to return. Built on the 51Degrees Pipeline API. An alternative to MaxMind and IPinfo.</description>
    <url>https://github.com/51Degrees/51degrees-java</url>

